      {
        "id": "529299",
        "date_added": "2026-11-19 10:14:51",
        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "FluxEngine loader dhlib.dll (Delphi, export InitModule), build Sep 2026. Same AES-256 ECB-wrapped-key + CBC container format and master key in all 4 known builds; reads a Cloudflare-API TXT dead drop, downloads /api/source-file.php?f=d3dx9_43.bin from the panel and hollows the decrypted payload (c424a715...e8c6) into attrib.exe. VirusTotal 2026-11-19: 23 detections, neither Kaspersky nor ESET flags it. Static analysis only; not executed. IOCs + YARA: github.com/harperjohnsai/detections (iocs/2026-11-fluxengine). More research: youtube.com/@HarperJohnsAI"
      }
    ],
